[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4741.91, "timestamp": "01:19:01", "text": "我小时候经常这样做，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4743.35, "timestamp": "01:19:03", "text": "呃，每当我们以前去拜访的时候……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4745.51, "timestamp": "01:19:05", "text": "乡村，我和我非常遥远的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4748.31, "timestamp": "01:19:08", "text": "亲戚们，呃，他们当时也是孩子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4750.87, "timestamp": "01:19:10", "text": "比如，“你们想挨一击吗？”和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4752.229, "timestamp": "01:19:12", "text": "当然，这显然不在考虑范围内。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4754.63, "timestamp": "01:19:14", "text": "英语。呃，你知道，那是在……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4756.229, "timestamp": "01:19:16", "text": "菲律宾人，但就像你们想的那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4758.51, "timestamp": "01:19:18", "text": "热门歌曲。他们掏出一盒该死的蜡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4761.59, "timestamp": "01:19:21", "text": "他们点燃蜡烛，给了我一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4763.03, "timestamp": "01:19:23", "text": "笔记本，然后我就想，“这他妈什么玩意儿”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4765.27, "timestamp": "01:19:25", "text": "我该如何处理这个？然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4767.669, "timestamp": "01:19:27", "text": "他们向我展示了他们如何撕下……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4769.75, "timestamp": "01:19:29", "text": "他们把一张纸卷起来，然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4772.07, "timestamp": "01:19:32", "text": "尖端烧焦了，他们把它吹灭了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4774.39, "timestamp": "01:19:34", "text": "它们能把所有的烟都吸走。而我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4777.669, "timestamp": "01:19:37", "text": "就像，“卧槽？这也太酷了吧。”我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4780.229, "timestamp": "01:19:40", "text": "我当时想，然后我就试了一下。而我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4782.39, "timestamp": "01:19:42", "text": "就像，“我的天哪，我到底是什么？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4784.59, "timestamp": "01:19:44", "text": "正在做？这味道像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4787.51, "timestamp": "01:19:47", "text": "“我当时就像在抽真他妈的烟一样。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4789.43, "timestamp": "01:19:49", "text": "烧焦的纸。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4791.189, "timestamp": "01:19:51", "text": "是的。你试过真正的香烟吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4794.87, "timestamp": "01:19:54", "text": "之前，杰基？我有。是的，你确实做到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4796.79, "timestamp": "01:19:56", "text": "你这个该死的恶心东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4799.669, "timestamp": "01:19:59", "text": "关于挑选新闻香烟？"}]